Step 1: Install PostgreSQL
Download: Go to PostgreSQL official site and choose your operating system (Windows, macOS, Linux).

Install: Run the installer. It will set up:

PostgreSQL server

pgAdmin (GUI tool for managing databases)

Command-line tools (psql)

Set Password: During installation, you’ll be asked to set a password for the default postgres user. Keep this safe.

password - tiger


pip install psycopg2
